WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.935
Day one is a check, not a lesson.

2
00:00:02.385 --> 00:00:03.659
It shows you where to start.

3
00:00:04.359 --> 00:00:08.466
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the page with the pictures.

4
00:00:08.916 --> 00:00:15.658
First, say the name of every picture on your child's page. Then a wrong name is not counted as a wrong answer.

5
00:00:16.108 --> 00:00:17.287
There are three parts.

6
00:00:17.737 --> 00:00:23.649
Part A. You say the first picture, and ask which of the other three starts like it. Your child points.

7
00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:30.811
Part B. The same, with rhymes. Which one rhymes with the first picture? Your page gives you the words to say.

8
00:00:31.261 --> 00:00:38.214
Part C has two halves. First you say three sounds slowly, and your child touches the picture. Say them like this.

9
00:00:43.782 --> 00:00:44.850
The word is net.

10
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:50.395
Short and clean, one second apart. Say sounds, not the names of letters.

11
00:00:50.845 --> 00:00:56.835
Then you point to a picture, and your child says its sounds. Mark it only if you hear all three, like this.

12
00:00:57.285 --> 00:00:58.286
The word is can.

13
00:01:02.352 --> 00:01:06.024
Do not teach, and do not correct today. Just listen and mark.

14
00:01:06.474 --> 00:01:12.191
Then read the yellow box at the bottom of your page, from the top. Stop at the first line that fits.

15
00:01:12.641 --> 00:01:18.404
That line tells you which days to do twice. Or that this plan is too easy, and where to go next.

16
00:01:18.854 --> 00:01:23.532
Write the three numbers on the page, and keep it. You will look at it again on the last day.
